  {
   "id": "nP5D3a0gBHUJ",
   "from": "William Beasley",
   "author": "8ffd6137fd43c6df",
   "date": "2014-05-02T14:12:39Z",
   "subject": "Re: Create reference manual",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Like James wrote, I typically use the <a href=\"https://github.com/wibeasley/Wats/blob/master/UtilityScripts/Refresh.R#L10\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wibeasley/Wats/blob/master/UtilityScripts/Refresh.R%23L10&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910753000&amp;usg=AOvVaw12sXuv_6IRUVbNUBp9Ca_D\">following line</a> to to inspect the documentation closely<div><span style=\"color:rgb(153,153,136);font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"><font face=\"courier new, monospace\">system(&quot;R CMD Rd2pdf --force --output=./DocumentationPeek.pdf .&quot; )</font></span></div><div><font color=\"#999988\" face=\"Consolas, Liberation Mono, Courier, monospace\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:18px;white-space:pre\"><i><br></i></span></font>And instead of deleting the file, I include a line in the <a href=\"https://github.com/wibeasley/Wats/blob/master/.Rbuildignore#L6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/wibeasley/Wats/blob/master/.Rbuildignore%23L6&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910753000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1iX-lZ-4hrR1xntsWdybRn\">.Rbuildignore</a> file so the build process doesn&#39;t produce a warning.  I like being able to look at the reference manual without having to install the package.  </div><div><br></div><div>There have also been a few times that the development version&#39;s manual has information that SAS users wanted to see; at that point it&#39;s really nice to post the GitHub <a href=\"https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksStaging/blob/master/NlsyLinks/NlsyLinksDocumentationPeek.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/LiveOak/NlsyLinksStaging/blob/master/NlsyLinks/NlsyLinksDocumentationPeek.pdf&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910753000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0wYn2mI_TQ3Gj2vKhpgMPw\">link</a>.</div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
