    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><br>On Sunday, August 16, 2015 at 5:19:09 PM UTC+3, Ayala Allon wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Thank you so much! I am starting the process of <span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Inconsolata, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:16px\">R CMD check for my package and I have some problems to solve and I don&#39;t even know where to begin. I am using Hadley&#39;s book on R packages of course, but I find it a bit hard for me to follow the checking chapter since I don&#39;t have experience with these topics. If you happen to know another source of help I can use I would greatly appreciate if you could refer me to it.</span></font></span><br></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Inconsolata, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:16px\"><br></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Inconsolata, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:16px\">Best,</span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Inconsolata, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:16px\"><br></span></font></span></div><div><span style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"Inconsolata, sans-serif\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:16px\">Ayala     </span></font></span><br><br>On Sunday, August 16, 2015 at 5:12:10 PM UTC+3, Greg Jefferis wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Dear Ayala,<div><br><div><div>On 16 Aug 2015, at 15:07, Ayala Allon &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">ayala...@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:</div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">&gt; system(&quot;R CMD Rd2pdf .&quot;)</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Hmm ... looks like a package</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Converting Rd files to LaTeX </div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Creating pdf output from LaTeX ...</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Error in texi2dvi(file = file, pdf = TRUE, clean = clean, quiet = quiet,  : </div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">  pdflatex is not available</div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">Error in texi2dvi(file = file, pdf = TRUE, clean = clean, quiet = quiet,  : </div><div style=\"font-family:Helvetica;font-size:12px;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\">  pdflatex is not available</div></blockquote><br></div><div>The error message looks fairly unambiguous – its seems like you do not have (pdf)latex installed on your system. i don’t see any mention of your operating system, but tex for mac is available here</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://tug.org/mactex/\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://tug.org/mactex/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910760000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2BqWJ4Wu0CYdQwAOQMgihD\">https://tug.org/mactex/</a></div><div><br></div><div>for windows, miktex seems to be popular.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Greg.</div><br><div>\r\n<div><div>--</div><div>Gregory Jefferis, PhD</div><div>Division of Neurobiology</div><div>MRC Laboratory of Molecular Biology</div><div>Francis Crick Avenue</div><div>Cambridge Biomedical Campus</div><div>Cambridge, CB2 OQH, UK</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910760000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0NW8YxTyAvkZnKQS8vGQ9V\">http://www2.mrc-lmb.cam.ac.uk/group-leaders/h-to-m/g-jefferis</a></div><div><a href=\"http://jefferislab.org\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://jefferislab.org&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910760000&amp;usg=AOvVaw15VzonananMV2GtLtyleZZ\">http://jefferislab.org</a></div><div><a href=\"http://flybrain.stanford.edu\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://flybrain.stanford.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792489910760000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1N_6SOlGtBUCccsCXfGbeH\">http://flybrain.stanford.edu</a></div></div>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n<br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></blockquote></div></div>"
